			"Message": "docs(Sky): Rewrite CHANGELOG.md with improved formatting and v2.2 entries\n\nRestructure the changelog with clearer section headers, expanded prose for each version entry, and document the v2.2 \"Bundled-Electron Profile: Correctness Pass\" release. The update covers the `sky:replay-events` invoke, channel-event bridge for terminal PTY communication, promise-protocol short-circuit in TauriChannel.call, and search-result format migration to VS Code ≥1.92 schema.",
			"SHA": "f87442b047efe2f43fd296e9d8f01380b2eb8868"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-29T04:56:50Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				102,
				1
			],
			"Message": "fix(Sky): Migrate search result format to VS Code ≥1.92 schema\n\nThe search panel was showing 0 results despite Mountain returning 2560 line-matches. VS Code ≥1.92 renamed the search result shape:\n- `preview.text` → `previewText`\n- `preview.matches` + `ranges` → `rangeLocations[]` with `{source, preview}` pairs\n\nStock vscode's `searchResult.add()` reads the new fields and silently rejects entries with the old shape. This change transforms Mountain's ripgrep results into the current `ITextSearchMatch` format, restoring search functionality.",
			"SHA": "7fa66748c591efbe26c807650c1c68db3e545256"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-29T04:33:50Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
